ive nodes (step_02); the one hub adjacent to the cohort (933) shares **no** edge with 18's triangle partners (steps 25, 26), so no hub is manufacturing fast closures. (c) Static connectivity alone is present but temporally invalid \u2014 exactly the failure mode the task warns about.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_cff95b90\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"closure_wave\",\n  \"entities\": [18, 26, 59, 102, 150, 168, 173, 196, 216, 248, 255, 269],\n  \"window\": [33039, 45039],\n  \"narrative\": \"Only two triangles touch this cohort: {59,150,248} and {18,1480,1586}. In both, the closing interaction arrives >=1500 time units after the latest supporting interaction (59-248 ~35k and 150-248 ~40.1k, closed by 59->150 only after 42039, with 248 silent past 40539; 18-1586 ~36.8k and 18-1480 ~39.8k, closed by 1586->1480 only after 42039). Every observed lag exceeds the 800-unit promptness criterion, so the triangles are static coincidences spread over the window, not a temporal closure wave. Low per-node degrees, absence of these nodes from the activity leaders, and the lack of any hub bridging the motifs rule out volume- and popularity-driven explanations.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.79,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_19\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_22\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_23\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_24\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_28\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_31\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"tra